; messages.xon -- the delve set: what the game says.

(message welcome "You enter the Delve.  The Lodestar lies twelve levels down; bring it back up.")
(message won "You climb out of the Delve with the Lodestar as the water closes behind you.")
(message stairs-down "You climb down to level {level}.")
(message stairs-up "You climb to level {level}; the water follows.")
(message no-way-up "The shaft above is flooded.  Only the Lodestar can open it.")
(message no-stairs "There is no shaft here.")
(message barred "The {name} stands over the shaft down.")
(message found-goal "The Lodestar is yours!  Climb, before the water rises.")
(message creature-near "You see {a-name}.")
(message explored "Nothing left to explore here.")
